      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To make myself more clear.\n\nI would like to request the addition of an interactable in world pedestal that lets you open a group's detail page.\n\nThis would be a useful feature for groups that want to promote their community to other users and it would lower the point of friction for users to join groups.\n\nThe pedestal would be a physical object similar to avatar pedestals that could be placed in any world and then any group ID or shortcode could be linked.",
